ang dimakan (ulat).","audio":{"01":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdullah-Al-Juhany/105005.mp3","02":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdul-Muhsin-Al-Qasim/105005.mp3","03":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Abdurrahman-as-Sudais/105005.mp3","04":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Ibrahim-Al-Dossari/105005.mp3","05":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Misyari-Rasyid-Al-Afasi/105005.mp3","06":"https://cdn.equran.id/audio-partial/Yasser-Al-Dosari/105005.mp3"}}]}